    "title": "Overpass retired: OpenStreetMap from our own copy only; Geofabrik's load and test fixed",
    "why": "OpenStreetMap's forum answered our statement (community.openstreetmap.org/t/150369): an app's fair share of the public Overpass servers is about 50 requests a day, and \"Stop using the public OSM overpass server altogether.\" Jason, in the session manager's pop-up: \"Stop entirely\". Also Jason's screenshot of Geofabrik's card: its pre-flight test \"Not ready: Answered 308\" and W1's load failed on our own loads.php answering the host's 503.",
